   sig="Vandover and the Brute is the most rigorous American naturalist novel and the best American treatment of the theme of degeneration: its analysis of a man's loss of will and its Darwinian conclusion make it the darkest and most theoretically consistent of Norris's books, and it has been recognised as one of the most important American novels of the 1890s.",
