   plot="A cheechako travels alone through the Yukon at seventy-five below zero, against the advice of an old-timer; he breaks through the ice, soaks his feet, builds a fire under a spruce tree, and the snow from the tree falls and extinguishes it, after which he cannot light another, and the story ends with the dog watching him die.",
